WEBVTT

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:03.380
My passionate idol activities,

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.280
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:18.580
Thanks for waiting!

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.080
Here's your special New Year's lucky daruma bento.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:26.190
We hope for your continued patronage this year as well.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:27.630
Please come again.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.090
I'll be sure to come.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.800
Sorry about this, Ichigo. I really wanted to let you relax for New Year's...

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:41.850
Don't worry, it's fun to finally work here again.

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:45.210
It's nice to see my rice scoop skills haven't started to rust yet.

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:48.520
I can hardly tell that you're an idol when you come back here to work.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:49.570
What was that?

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:51.480
Are you saying my aura is weak?

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.180
Well?

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:57.780
Nice! I can totally see it.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:00:59.660
You really seem like an idol.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:01.820
I <i>said</i> that I <i>am</i> an idol!

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:04.160
Happy New Year!

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:09.000
Ichigo, hey there.

00:01:10.030 --> 00:01:10.820
Girls!

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.010
Nee-san!

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:13.970
Happy New Year.

00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:14.900
It's been a while.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:16.510
Raichi, how've you been?

00:01:17.350 --> 00:01:18.300
Hello, everyone.

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:21.120
I haven't seen them since I transferred.

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:23.020
It's been way too long!

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:26.730
Your idol smile's too bright.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:29.150
That aura of yours is overwhelming!

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:31.520
What's that supposed to mean?

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:34.810
Hey, Ichigo. Do you think I could have an autograph?

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:36.300
Sure, of course.

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:37.720
Write me one too!

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:39.430
Me too, me too! {Kana Asumii!!!}

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:42.940
A rare shot of Nee-san in a kimono!

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:44.850
I'm taking super rare pics!

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:49.780
Hey, Raichi.

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:52.050
Yes, what is it?

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:55.710
Has Ichigo been eating a lot since the New Year?

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.750
Now that I look at her...

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:17.310
Hi, signalize!

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:22.650
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:22.650
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.540
No, that's wrong

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.540
iie chigau yo

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:29.920
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:29.920
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:31.710
Do that signalize!

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:36.890
Something's starting to bubble up

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:36.890
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:40.850
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:40.850
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:44.390
So I'll believe in the present

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:44.390
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:49.560
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:49.560
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:50.900
Chance for me

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:56.200
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:56.200
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:00.410
It's just another challenge on the way

00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:00.410
hora chousen matteru yo

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:05.330
Where are we headed?

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:05.330
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:09.080
Into a brilliant hope

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:09.080
mabushii kibou no naka e

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:16.340
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:16.340
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:19.720
Where we're headed

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:19.720
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.600
is into our hopes for the future

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.600
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:30.940
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:30.940
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.690
Ichigo-chan and I?

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:40.810
Yes.

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:45.070
I want you to pair up with Hoshimiya for the next Special Live and sing a few songs.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:47.610
It's not that I mind, but...

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:51.710
Is Ichigo-chan really at a high enough level to perform at the Special Stage?

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:53.370
I wonder about that...

00:03:56.490 --> 00:04:00.440
I might end up completely crushing her, you know.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:08.130
It's certainly true that Hoshimiya can't match your quality right now.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.400
However,

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:12.750
she might be able to cause <i>something</i> to happen.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:13.850
"Something"?

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:18.230
I feel a faint potential from within that girl—

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.740
A natural ability to draw others to her.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:23.860
A star...

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.240
So I have to pair with her no matter what?

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:30.270
Yes. I'm not just asking you for a favor, Mizuki.

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.530
I understand.

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:37.000
Ah, it's Mizuki-chan!

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:40.170
We'll tell you the stars' favorite shops.

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:42.880
Our first guest this year is here today.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:44.680
I'm Kanzaki Mizuki.

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:48.430
Mizuki-sama's favorite shop is just like her–gorgeous.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.890
She gets to eat her favorite foods at work.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.640
Mizuki-chan's so lucky.

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:54.640
The meat's ready.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.590
Okay.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:04:59.150
Delicious!

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:02.830
There's still plenty of meat, so eat to your heart's content.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.080
I will!

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:05.910
More rice please.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:06.910
No problem.

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:09.280
Onee-chan, how many times was that?

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:10.890
It's my fifth bowl.

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:13.330
Did you always eat that much?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.570
It's probably because it's Mama's cooking.

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:18.290
It's the best!

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:23.850
I get really fired up seeing you enjoy it so much, too.

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:24.420
Here.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:27.430
Thanks!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:33.930
It's great! Is this Kyoto style?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:36.830
This is my first time eating New Year's rice cakes in miso.

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.900
It has quite the deep flavor.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:41.770
How much mochi do you want in your New Year's soup?

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:42.550
One piece.

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:45.600
Two—no, three pieces!

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.990
Are you in love right now, Mizuki-chan?

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:51.620
I'm rather preoccupied with my work right now,

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.990
but I really do admire those who work hard together for their love.

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:56.620
I do too.

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:59.650
Would you two like some cake for dessert?

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.550
Yeah, I'll have some!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.960
Even Mizuki gets curious about this mature flavor of chocolate.

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:09.000
Kit Choco Bar.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:12.430
A friend gave me some chocolate as a souvenir from Hawaii...

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.100
Ooh! I'll have some!

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:16.150
Is it okay to eat so much?

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:18.070
School's about to start again.

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:20.980
Don't worry, it's fine. I'll start holding back tomorrow.

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:25.410
Ichigo, good morning!

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:26.640
Coming!

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:28.560
I'm here!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.770
I-Ichigo?!

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:36.580
This is a souvenir from your vacation abroad?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:40.330
Yep! I powan~ed at first sight.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.560
I wanted everyone else to powawan~ too!

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.290
"P-Powawan"?

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:47.930
By the way, where did you go abroad to?

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:51.800
I went to Neverland. It was full of Love You,

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:54.220
and I powawan~ed my heart out!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.780
O-Oh...

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:57.410
We're back!

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.190
I could hear you coming a mile awa—

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.680
Ichigo-chan, love you!

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:09.680
Um, you're Ichigo... right?

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:11.670
How could you?

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:13.840
Did you forget about me over the break?

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:16.830
No, no, no, I could never forget you...

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.750
but what the heck happened to you?!

00:07:19.220 --> 00:07:21.620
You know, I just ate a bit much.

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:23.990
There's no way you can call that "a bit".

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:26.150
Love you!

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:28.310
Otome-chan, let's spend this year together too.

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:30.600
Yeah, please continue to be my friend.

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:33.600
Do you want some Pop'n Popcorn?

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:37.070
Can I? Thanks!

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:39.890
Delicious!

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:42.270
Ichigo-tan, love you!

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:44.060
"Ichigo-tan"?

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:48.190
Otome-chan's already seeing Ichigo as 
nothing more than a mascot character.

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:50.280
A mascot, huh.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.480
How is <i>that</i> supposed to be an idol?

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:56.350
New Year start!

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:59.080
And it's a showtime!

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:02.320
Happy New Year, honeys!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.790
Who are you?

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:06.540
Huh?

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.740
Wha—is that supposed to be Hoshimiya?

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:11.060
Oh my God!

00:08:11.060 --> 00:08:13.830
That's not a figure becoming of an idol at all.

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.370
No!

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:19.410
Geez, you sure do like to exaggerate, Johnny-sensei.

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:23.730
Don't worry. I just need to exercise for a bit.

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.690
Okay, I believe in you, Honey.

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:28.070
Good!

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:31.310
Getting back to business, it's a showtime!

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:35.950
I've got a great New Year's present for you happy honeys!

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:37.490
Really? A present?

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:42.820
Yes! I've brought a great audition befitting the start of the New Year.

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:44.250
Good job, me.

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:48.130
It's called the New Year Shining Girl Audition.

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:50.000
It'll be held in one week.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:54.090
Shining Girl! That sounds fun! Well, Ichigo?

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.950
I don't really feel like it anymore.

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.010
Maybe I'll pass on it.

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:01.770
You're not entering?

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:07.900
Now then, any honeys that want to take this audition put your hand up!

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:08.820
Here!

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:09.640
Huh?

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:12.400
Sensei, Ichigo says she definitely wants to participate.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:14.400
I do?

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.910
That's more like it, Ichigo. 
Let's get to our special training.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.910
No way!

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:26.690
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:32.390 --> 00:09:34.420
Hey, it's still the first lap.

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.300
I can't go on!

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:39.460
If you don't get up, you're going to fail the audition.

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:40.930
Come on, get up already.

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:44.570
Ichigo...

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:45.730
Stand up already.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:49.220
I-Impossible. Please let me off the hook.

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:50.980
We haven't even been going for one minute yet.

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:53.480
Th-This is it for today.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:56.780
Tomorrow... tomorrow I'll do my best.

00:09:57.590 --> 00:10:03.080
Aikatsu, Aikatsu...

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.580
This smell is...

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:10.880
Ichigo-tan, want to eat some Pop'n Popcorn?

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:12.660
I do, I do!

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:14.840
Hey, we're still in the middle of practice!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.270
Starting tomorrow, tomorrow.

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:26.140
Finally lunch time!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:27.940
I'm so hungry.

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:29.690
Thanks for the food.

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:36.690
Food after a workout is especially good.

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:38.570
You can't call that a workout...

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.020
Don't you think you're eating too much?

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:44.700
You need to get back to normal before the audition.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:46.530
You don't need to worry.

00:10:46.530 --> 00:10:50.710
I always gain some weight with the new year, but I lose it before I can realize it.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:53.710
But you get winded right after we start exercising.

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:57.050
I heard you already. I'll start tomorrow.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.050
I'll start my diet tomorrow.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:03.730
Ichigo. I need you to come with me when you're done eating.

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:07.890
Right. We need to give you a huge shocker before it's too late.

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:10.440
Aoi... huh?

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:22.850
Why'd you bring me here?

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:23.820
You'll see.

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:27.700
Ichigo, have you decided on what coord to wear for the audition?

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:30.030
Yeah, it's this...

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:32.590
Angely Sugar's Sweet Restaurant, huh.

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.540
Could you try it on now?

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:36.570
Huh? Sure...

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:52.270
Huh? But, why?

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:56.610
Why won't it open? I'm sure I set the cards correctly...

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:59.880
Is it saying that the size is too small for me to fit?

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:01.940
It's not that, Ichigo.

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:06.570
It's because you're forgetting the most important thing about being an idol.

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:09.450
We're not trying to say that gaining weight is a bad thing.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:14.170
But just where did the Ichigo who always did her best to shine go?

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:21.140
You're putting things off and saying you'll "do them tomorrow".

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:24.200
That's not the Hoshimiya Ichigo that <i>I</i> know.

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:31.440
Did we hit her too hard?

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.550
Good morning.

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:39.740
Morning.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:41.940
Good morning.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:48.780
<i>Mizuki-chan looked so disappointed with me...</i>

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:51.020
<i>That's right...</i>

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:57.010
<i>Mizuki-chan always gives her all in order to shine as brightly as possible for her fans.</i>

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:59.500
<i>The most important thing...</i>

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:02.650
<i>is to always do your best to shine!</i>

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:04.140
I...

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:06.090
I'm going for a run.

00:13:06.250 --> 00:13:07.250
Ichigo.

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:10.100
Looks like you've got a bit of your motivation back.

00:13:10.230 --> 00:13:12.900
Yeah. Oh, could it be?

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:15.440
Was the reason you made me take the audition also to...

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:17.740
Sorry for forcing it onto you.

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:20.910
But we just got worried looking at you laze around like that.

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:23.110
Acting as soon as you think.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:26.330
It finally feels like you've come back to us.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:27.470
Ran...

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.120
Thanks, you two.

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.340
Okay! Here I go!

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:38.130
Otome-chan.

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:41.130
From the looks of her she's been running for a while.

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:43.630
I can't afford to lose here.

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:49.010
She's fast.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.180
My muscles ache!

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:58.300
I feel like I'm having deja vu.

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:01.190
It's fine to get pumped up, but you shouldn't run <i>that</i> hard.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.340
Only one week until the audition.

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:06.800
I'll make up for the training I skipped, even if I have to push my limits.

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:10.830
Oh well. I guess I'll join up with your training.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:14.340
Me too. We <i>did</i> force you to enter, after all.

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:15.950
Will you really join me?

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:20.750
Yeah. Plus, I also let my guard down during New Years...

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:22.720
Same here.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:28.080
Now, let's start the idol-style diet that I created!

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:32.570
Keep your heartrate at about 60% of it's maximum,

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:37.900
and do at least 20 minutes of aerobic exercise in order to efficiently burn your fat away.

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:41.320
It's a two-for-one where your dancing improves too!

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:46.330
Focus on moving your diaphragm up and down while performing abdominal breathing.

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:49.180
This'll let you say goodbye to the fat around your stomach!

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:52.350
Align your center of balance with the rest of your body,

00:14:52.350 --> 00:14:54.400
and focus on your abs and inner thighs.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:56.840
Shape your legs by doing model walking!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:59.870
This is the road to our shining runway!

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:06.350
So an idol-style diet is just constant training.

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:11.030
Looks tasty...

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:12.100
No, no!

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:16.180
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.190
You did it, Ichigo!

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:23.190
Yeah, I slimmed down in time for the audition.

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:28.940
Are you planning to train more? There's isn't much time until the audition, and it'd be better for you to rest.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.840
I just can't stop moving.

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:34.070
And when I weighed myself earlier, I gained 100 grams since this morning.

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:35.860
Just 100 grams?

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:38.200
Are you a boxer trying to stay in your weight class?

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.760
I'm gonna go run as long as I can.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:48.130
Aikatsu, Aikatsu...

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:52.060
I should've eaten more for lunch...

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:54.330
No, I can't lose to this!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:58.470
Aikatsu, Aikatsu...

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:00.670
Isn't that a bit much?

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.600
I can barely move anymore.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.860
This smell is...

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:17.130
What're you doing?

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:24.300
Nothing! I just smelled something really good from here...

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:25.880
You found me out.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.800
Well, whatever.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:29.880
Take this and keep quiet.

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:34.300
I-I'm fine! My stomach's full anyway.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.640
Just take it already.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:43.130
Don't they say girls have a second stomach for sweets? Not that I'd know.

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:46.260
Now you're my partner in crime.

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:48.170
Don't tell anyone about this. {what the fuck did this line get through...}

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:49.890
G-Got it!

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:55.410
Need something else? If not, get going.

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:59.030
Um, thank you very much.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:05.540
I wanna eat it...

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:07.510
But I shouldn't.

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:09.510
Mizuki-chan.

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:17.730
Mizuki-san!

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:21.680
W-Would you like a baked potato?

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:24.230
Eh, a baked potato?

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:27.260
I see, a diet.

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:30.940
Right. I indulged myself too much during New Year's.

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:34.170
So, well... I gained weight.

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:38.950
I couldn't even control myself... I really am hopeless.

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:45.910
It might be impossible to be exactly like you, but I need to be more stoic.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:50.000
"Stoic", huh.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.300
Even I let myself go sometimes.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.840
What? I can't even imagine that.

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:05.210
Really? After particularly difficult lessons, 
sometimes I have ice cream as a reward to myself.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:11.170
You have an audition today, right?

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.890
If you don't eat something, you won't have the energy to go on.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:18.680
Well then, I'll take this as a reward to myself for my week of hard work.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.540
Sweet!

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:28.060
<i>I feel a faint potential from within that girl—</i>

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:30.420
<i>A natural ability to draw others to her.</i>

00:18:32.070 --> 00:18:34.290
That's enough for me.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:36.770
Do your best with the audition.

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.140
Thank you very much.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:44.610
Alright then, here I go.

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:45.680
Go for it!

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:48.090
Don't let your stomach grumble on the runway.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:51.780
Don't worry! I gave myself a reward to recharge!

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:52.990
See you after!

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:29.390
That was a wonderful outfit to match your walk.

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:31.600
Congratulations, Hoshimiya.

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:33.170
Thank you very much!

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:37.660
And so, I believe you're all aware of this,

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:40.380
but because you four have passed your various auditions

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:43.320
we are giving you the right to apply for the drama auditions.

00:21:43.500 --> 00:21:44.650
Huh?!

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:49.870
From that reaction, it almost seems as though this is the first time you've heard of this.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:52.370
Information mistake!

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:54.700
Bad job, me.

00:21:54.860 --> 00:21:56.210
Come on now...

00:21:56.430 --> 00:21:59.210
We'll be rivals this time, Ichigo.

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:01.790
Well, I don't intend to lose, though.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:03.710
Otome is fired up!

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:06.980
A drama audition... I wonder how it'll be?

00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:08.720
I'm so excited!

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.850
Ichigo-chan... can she keep up with me?

00:23:55.700 --> 00:23:58.990
This sounds great, Aoi! It's an audition for "Useless Detective"!

00:23:58.990 --> 00:24:01.720
It's our first venture into drama! Let's aim to pass!

00:24:01.720 --> 00:24:03.100
I won't lose to a fake.

00:24:03.100 --> 00:24:04.040
Huh?

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:05.490
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:05.490 --> 00:24:06.730
Naughty Detective.

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:10.700
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
